# XInput (SPK-01, hardware-matrix): Pad A holds east and south when it is
# unplugged. SDL sends their ups, then removed. The pad comes back with a
# new id while both are still held; XInput reports no down for them, just
# an up of each when it is released. Those orphan ups do nothing and do not
# confirm the slot; the next press of south does, and taps Ctrl+Z.
